# Boss Hunting optional API credentials (example only; keep real values out of Git).
#
# Copy this file to your user configuration directory:
#   Windows : %APPDATA%\boss-hunting\credentials.env
#   Linux   : ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/boss-hunting/credentials.env
#   macOS   : ~/.config/boss-hunting/credentials.env
# or point BOSS_HUNTING_CREDENTIALS_FILE at any other path.
#
# Every key is an optional accelerator. Missing keys fall back to anonymous
# official APIs, Browser Use on official public pages, or alternative sources.

